cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "NiceMill: Positive Feedback Generation from Collaborative Interaction Videos Using Local Vision-Language Models"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Hamada"
    given-names: "Reo"
    affiliation: "Shonan Institute of Technology"
  - family-names: "Shuzo"
    given-names: "Masaki"
    affiliation: "Shonan Institute of Technology"
abstract: >-
  NiceMill writes per-person positive-feedback texts from collaborative-interaction videos with a
  local vision-language model. Each text is shown with the video scenes it is based on, and a
  person checks it before it is finalized.
  (Japanese title of the paper: ローカルVLMを用いた協働インタラクション動画からのポジティブ・フィードバック生成)
repository-code: "https://github.com/hamadareo/NiceMill"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - positive feedback
  - vision-language model
  - local inference
  - collaborative interaction
# preferred-citation / publication: to be decided
#   (presented as Poster No. 37 at the 17th Dialogue System Symposium)
